        {
          "text": "Walipoamka mapema alfajiri, Samweli akamwita Sauli darini, akamwambia, \"Jiandae, nami nitakuaga uende zako.\" Sauli alipokuwa tayari yeye na Samweli wakatoka nje pamoja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
